[I] Post-quantum signing, KEMs and sealed input records in C11

[T] A C11 library and command-line tool, with no dependencies, that seals a
[T] folder of files with a post-quantum signature.
[T] Anyone can check later, offline, that every file is unchanged and which key
[T] sealed it.
[T] It implements ML-DSA (FIPS 204), SLH-DSA (FIPS 205), Ed25519, ML-KEM
[T] (FIPS 203), HQC, SHA-2 and SHA-3.

[U] https://github.com/rootcoder007/noqtis

[A] Vansh Singh Ruhela
[M] Vansh Singh Ruhela <vsruhela@proton.me>

[C] extra/crypto
[F] CROSS OBJDIR

[L] APL
[V] 0.1.4
